        "topic:output-size-root-cause",
        "topic:output",
        "topic:root",
        "topic:cause"
      ],
      "body": "The provider honours the requested image size parameter. This was checked with three requests at different sizes and against the provider's own model page. The fixed dimensions came from our client: a default in the client config overwrote the size we passed. The earlier suspicion that the provider ignored the parameter was a false alarm.",
